          "description": "\n\n**Future-start programs:** if this field is enrolled ONLY in a future-start (upcoming) program, it is NOT assessable yet - this returns 404. It becomes assessable on the program start date (enrollment + assessment both open then)."
        },
        {
          "v": "17",
          "name": "GET Field Regen Health Index (score-based + categories)",
          "method": "GET",
          "endpoint": "<<baseUrl>>/assessments/my/fields/<<fieldId>>/regen-index",
          "headers": [],
          "params": [],
          "body": {
            "contentType": null,
            "body": null
          },
          "auth": {
            "authType": "bearer",
            "authActive": true,
            "token": "<<token>>"
          },
          "preRequestScript": "",
          "testScript": "pw.test(\"200\", () => pw.expect(pw.response.status).toBe(200));",
          "requestVariables": [],
          "description": "The Regen Health Index for ONE field - the SCORE-based overall index (0-100, from the farmer's answers scored 0-3) plus per-category scores, a rating label (Excellent/Good/Fair/Needs work/Poor), and the top category. This is the per-field version of the farm dashboard's Regen Index. Field must belong to the caller (else 404). FARMER token.\n\nNOTE: this is different from `/summary` - summary shows COMPLETION % (how many questions answered), this shows the SCORE % (how good the answers are).\n\n### Expected (200)\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Field regen health index fetched.\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"field\": { \"id\": \"...\", \"name\": \"Good Yard\", \"farmId\": \"...\", \"farmName\": \"Red Line\" },\n    \"regenHealthIndex\": 68,\n    \"rating\": \"Good\",\n    \"topCategory\": \"Biodiversity & habitat\",\n    \"categories\": [\n      { \"id\": \"...\", \"name\": \"Soil health & biology\", \"score\": 56, \"answered\": 6 },\n      { \"id\": \"...\", \"name\": \"Water cycle & management\", \"score\": 73, \"answered\": 5 },\n      { \"id\": \"...\", \"name\": \"Biodiversity & habitat\", \"score\": 89, \"answered\": 6 }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n(`regenHealthIndex`/`score`/`rating` are null when nothing is answered yet.)",
          "responses": {}
        },
